    "name": "White Onion",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">White onion or Allium cepa are a cultivar of dry onion which have a distinct light and mild flavour profile. Much like red onions, they have a high sugar and low sulphur content, and thus have a relatively short shelf life. White onions are used in a variety of dishes, such as those of Mexican and European origin</span></p>",
